210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 181 0 R
/T (Over the past year, I have found myself having more and more conversations with early childhood educators who are trying incredibly hard to keep children safe, follow changing expectations and make thoughtful decisions in moments that often happen very quickly, yet underneath those conversations I keep hearing the same uncertainty coming through.)
/E (Over the past year, I have found myself having more and more conversations with early childhood educators who are trying incredibly hard to keep children safe, follow changing expectations and make thoughtful decisions in moments that often happen very quickly, yet underneath those conversations I keep hearing the same uncertainty coming through.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
