/S /H2
/P 182 0 R
/T (There is no single response that will be right for every child, and that is exactly why I wanted to create this resource.)
/E (There is no single response that will be right for every child, and that is exactly why I wanted to create this resource.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
