228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 182 0 R
/T (My hope is that it gives educators and leaders a calmer place to have these conversations together, so that instead of each person privately wondering whether they are getting it right, teams can begin building a shared understanding of what safe, responsive and respectful support can look like in everyday practice.)
/E (My hope is that it gives educators and leaders a calmer place to have these conversations together, so that instead of each person privately wondering whether they are getting it right, teams can begin building a shared understanding of what safe, responsive and respectful support can look like in everyday practice.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 182 0 R
/T (This guide is not legal advice, and every service will still need to follow its own policies, Approved Provider guidance and the requirements of its regulatory authority, but I hope it helps us move away from fear and towards thoughtful practice, where child safety and genuine human connection are allowed to strengthen one another rather than being treated as competing priorities.)
/E (This guide is not legal advice, and every service will still need to follow its own policies, Approved Provider guidance and the requirements of its regulatory authority, but I hope it helps us move away from fear and towards thoughtful practice, where child safety and genuine human connection are allowed to strengthen one another rather than being treated as competing priorities.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
