/E (I have actually put off writing this guide for quite a while, because this year I have found myself doing something I did not expect to be doing after so many years in this field. I have been questioning parts of the trauma-informed practice, behaviour support training and co-regulation knowledge that I have spent years learning, teaching and applying alongside children, families and educators.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
