870 0 obj
<<
/Title (For a child whose nervous system is already highly activated, that small opportunity to participate can make an enormous difference, because rather than grabbing first, we are giving them a clear explanation, offering them some agency within the situation and showing them that our intention is to protect rather than punish or control.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 772 0 R
/Prev 869 0 R
>>
endobj
871 0 obj
<<
