2218 0 obj
<<
/Title (I also think it is important that we do not make the idea of child led touch too simplistic, because young children do not always have the words to clearly tell us what they need.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1179 0 R
/Next 2229 0 R
>>
endobj
2219 0 obj
<<
/Title (All of those children are communicating something.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1179 0 R
